{"id":"be21afa871789456","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-field.md","title":"Field Characteristic","display":"df-field — Field Characteristic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-field","aliases":["57-df-field"],"display":"df-field — Field Characteristic","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-field — Field Characteristic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}\">\\(0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}\\)</span> 是互异形式符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{inv}\">\\(\\mathrm{inv}\\)</span> 也排印为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"{}^{-1}\">\\({}^{-1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\">\\(-\\)</span> 为一元负号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\)</span> 保持这些非逻辑符号组成的集合。逻辑字母与变量见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})\\)</span>；在涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 的下式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_A,1_A,+_A,\\cdot_A,-_A,\\mathrm{inv}_A\">\\(0_A,1_A,+_A,\\cdot_A,-_A,\\mathrm{inv}_A\\)</span> 分别表示相应符号解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,x\\in A\">\\(a,b,c,x\\in A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}\\)</span> 对所有这样的结构定义，不预先假定域公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 是供域条目使用的结构谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 是以下递归定义的幂与有限系数列求值。列的首项为常数项。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\{S_{\\mathrm{ring}},\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\{S_{\\mathrm{ring}},\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\}\\)</span>；涉及符号分区的各式分别对这两种下标成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm{ring}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_0(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_1(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{-,\\mathrm{inv}\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge3),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{-,\\mathrm{inv},+,\\times\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Struct}(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm{ring}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_0(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_1(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{-,\\mathrm{inv}\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge3),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau&amp;\\coloneqq\\{-,\\mathrm{inv},+,\\times\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Struct}(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n0\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a&amp;\\coloneqq0_A,\\qquad\n(n+1)\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a\\coloneqq(n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a)+_A a,\\\\\nZ_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n\\ge1\\land n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A=0_A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}0,&amp;Z_{\\mathfrak A}=\\varnothing,\\\\\\min Z_{\\mathfrak A},&amp;Z_{\\mathfrak A}\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=0&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ge1\\ (n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A\\ne0_A),\\\\\n\\forall n\\ge1\\quad \\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=n&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\nn\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A=0_A\\land\\forall m\\ (1\\le m&lt;n\\to m\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A\\ne0_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n0\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a&amp;\\coloneqq0_A,\\qquad\n(n+1)\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a\\coloneqq(n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a)+_A a,\\\\\nZ_{\\mathfrak A}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n\\ge1\\land n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A=0_A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}0,&amp;Z_{\\mathfrak A}=\\varnothing,\\\\\\min Z_{\\mathfrak A},&amp;Z_{\\mathfrak A}\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=0&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ge1\\ (n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A\\ne0_A),\\\\\n\\forall n\\ge1\\quad \\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=n&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\nn\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A=0_A\\land\\forall m\\ (1\\le m&lt;n\\to m\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A\\ne0_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak A)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;0_A\\ne1_A\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\ \\bigl[\n(a+_A b)+_A c=a+_A(b+_A c)\\land a+_A b=b+_A a\\land a+_A0_A=a\\land a+_A(-_A a)=0_A\\\\\n&amp;\\land(a\\cdot_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_A c)\\land a\\cdot_A b=b\\cdot_A a\\land a\\cdot_A1_A=a\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\cdot_A(b+_A c)=(a\\cdot_A b)+_A(a\\cdot_A c)\n\\land(a\\ne0_A\\to a\\cdot_A\\mathrm{inv}_A(a)=1_A)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,0)&amp;\\coloneqq1_A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,n+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,n)\\cdot_A a,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\langle\\rangle,x)&amp;\\coloneqq0_A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec b,x)\n\\coloneqq a+_A(x\\cdot_A\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec b,x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak A)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;0_A\\ne1_A\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\ \\bigl[\n(a+_A b)+_A c=a+_A(b+_A c)\\land a+_A b=b+_A a\\land a+_A0_A=a\\land a+_A(-_A a)=0_A\\\\\n&amp;\\land(a\\cdot_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_A c)\\land a\\cdot_A b=b\\cdot_A a\\land a\\cdot_A1_A=a\\\\\n&amp;\\land a\\cdot_A(b+_A c)=(a\\cdot_A b)+_A(a\\cdot_A c)\n\\land(a\\ne0_A\\to a\\cdot_A\\mathrm{inv}_A(a)=1_A)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,0)&amp;\\coloneqq1_A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,n+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,n)\\cdot_A a,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\langle\\rangle,x)&amp;\\coloneqq0_A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec b,x)\n\\coloneqq a+_A(x\\cdot_A\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec b,x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原特征正数分支把 n=0 也纳入双条件，与零特征分支冲突。现在 Char 是显式总函数。Field、幂和多项式求值只补齐后续条目实际需要的接口；Char 自身仍可用于不满足域公理的结构。逆元在零处未额外指定取值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}$ 是互异形式符号；$\\mathrm{inv}$ 也排印为 ${}^{-1}$，$-$ 为一元负号。$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}$ 保持这些非逻辑符号组成的集合。逻辑字母与变量见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{inv}","display":false},{"tex":"{}^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"-","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"0_A,1_A,+_A,\\cdot_A,-_A,\\mathrm{inv}_A","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c,x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\{S_{\\mathrm{ring}},\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nS_{\\mathrm{ring}}&\\coloneqq\\{0,1,+,\\times,-,\\mathrm{inv}\\},\\qquad\n\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Var}\\cup S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\cup\\mathrm{LogSym},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Const}_\\tau&\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Func}_0(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_1(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{-,\\mathrm{inv}\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_2(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\{+,\\times\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge3),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau&\\coloneqq\\{-,\\mathrm{inv},+,\\times\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{Func}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Func}_n(\\tau),\\quad\\mathrm{Rel}_\\tau^n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(\\tau),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Struct}(\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n0\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a&\\coloneqq0_A,\\qquad\n(n+1)\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a\\coloneqq(n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}a)+_A a,\\\\\nZ_{\\mathfrak A}&\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:n\\ge1\\land n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A=0_A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}0,&Z_{\\mathfrak A}=\\varnothing,\\\\\\min Z_{\\mathfrak A},&Z_{\\mathfrak A}\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=0&\\longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\ge1\\ (n\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A\\ne0_A),\\\\\n\\forall n\\ge1\\quad \\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak A)=n&\\longleftrightarrow\nn\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A=0_A\\land\\forall m\\ (1\\le m<n\\to m\\cdot^{\\mathfrak A}1_A\\ne0_A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak A)\\longleftrightarrow{}&0_A\\ne1_A\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in A\\ \\bigl[\n(a+_A b)+_A c=a+_A(b+_A c)\\land a+_A b=b+_A a\\land a+_A0_A=a\\land a+_A(-_A a)=0_A\\\\\n&\\land(a\\cdot_A b)\\cdot_A c=a\\cdot_A(b\\cdot_A c)\\land a\\cdot_A b=b\\cdot_A a\\land a\\cdot_A1_A=a\\\\\n&\\land a\\cdot_A(b+_A c)=(a\\cdot_A b)+_A(a\\cdot_A c)\n\\land(a\\ne0_A\\to a\\cdot_A\\mathrm{inv}_A(a)=1_A)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,0)&\\coloneqq1_A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,n+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{pow}_{\\mathfrak A}(a,n)\\cdot_A a,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\langle\\rangle,x)&\\coloneqq0_A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\langle a\\rangle\\frown\\vec b,x)\n\\coloneqq a+_A(x\\cdot_A\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec b,x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}.","display":true}],"bytes":4008,"backlinks":[{"id":"2f1b489ae787f3c0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak F\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})$ 且 $\\mathrm{Field}(\\mathfrak F)$，$F=|\\mathfrak F|$。结构论域见 [[57-df-structure]]；域谓词、环语言分区和有限系数列求值 $\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak F}$ 见 [[57-df-field]]。$0_F=0^{\\mathfrak F}$。"},{"id":"9a1792a4c383672b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S_{\\mathrm{ring}})$，$R=|\\mathfrak R|$，$\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathfrak R)=0$；环语言、特征、$\\mathrm{Field}$ 与求值函数 $\\mathrm{PE}_{\\mathfrak R}$ 见 [[57-df-field]]。"},{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $p=0$ 或 $p$ 为素数。$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}$、$\\mathrm{Field}$、$\\mathrm{Char}$ 见 [[57-df-field]]，$\\mathrm{ACF}$ 见 [[57-df-acf]]。保留原逆元函数在零处未指定值的约定。$g$ 为该有限语言的有效编码；$\\vdash$ 为标准 Hilbert 推导，$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 取 [[57-df-decidable-theory]]。$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}$；$\\mathrm{EffQE}$ 在下式定义，$\\mathrm{Rec}(q)$ 是函数递归性，$q$ 是总函数。"},{"id":"d5d65b2fd44760f8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}$ 保持 [[57-df-field]] 的原语言（其中没有 $<$）；$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^<$ 是其加入一个新二元关系符号 $<$ 的扩展，其他符号分区保持不变。$\\mathfrak R$ 是环语言结构，$<_R\\subseteq R^2$，$R=|\\mathfrak R|$；$\\mathfrak R^<$ 为把 $<$ 解释为 $<_R$ 的同载体扩张。$\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}$ 取 [[57-df-rcf]]，不把原 $\\mathrm{RCF}$ 谓词替换成它。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^<}$；$\\mathrm{QF}$ 与满足取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]、[[57-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[5